menu "ESP32 Companion"

config COMPANION_HARDWARE_DIAGNOSTICS
    bool
    default y
    help
        Shared runtime for this fixed board, its standalone conversation loop
        and the local USB diagnostic tools. The standalone profile starts saved
        Wi-Fi automatically; local diagnostic profiles boot offline.

config COMPANION_SESSION_PROBE
    bool "Companion manual authenticated session check"
    depends on COMPANION_HARDWARE_DIAGNOSTICS
    default n
    help
        Add a manual USB serial session check to local diagnostics. The device
        credential is provisioned privately over USB into NVS. Wi-Fi stays off
        at boot and wake words remain local. No voice or audio is uploaded.

config COMPANION_GEMINI_SETUP_PROBE
    bool "Companion direct Gemini setup check"
    depends on COMPANION_SESSION_PROBE
    default n
    help
        Add a manual secure WebSocket setup/close check using a fresh temporary
        session credential. No question or microphone audio is sent.

config COMPANION_GEMINI_VOICE_PROBE
    bool "Companion manual Gemini speaker check"
    depends on COMPANION_GEMINI_SETUP_PROBE
    default n
    help
        Receive one fixed greeting, close the cloud connection, then play
        bounded 24 kHz PCM through the existing output task. No audio upload.

config COMPANION_MICROPHONE_PREP
    bool "Companion local microphone preparation"
    depends on COMPANION_GEMINI_VOICE_PROBE
    default n
    help
        Use four-second local captures and measure raw I2S headroom before
        conversion. Wake-word gain is unchanged; microphone audio is not uploaded.

config COMPANION_MICROPHONE_SHIFT
    int "Local capture PCM right shift"
    depends on COMPANION_MICROPHONE_PREP
    range 12 18
    default 15
    help
        Fixed capture-only conversion gain. Each extra bit adds approximately
        6 dB of digital headroom. Existing wake-word conversion remains at 12.

config COMPANION_GEMINI_QUESTION_PROBE
    bool "Companion manual microphone question"
    depends on COMPANION_MICROPHONE_PREP
    default n
    help
        Add an explicit USB-started four-second microphone question, followed
        by a bounded Gemini audio reply. Wake and calibration remain local.

config COMPANION_CLOUD_WAKE
    bool "Companion explicitly armed wake question"
    depends on COMPANION_GEMINI_QUESTION_PROBE
    default n
    help
        Permit one wake-triggered microphone question after an explicit USB
        arm command. Boot and ordinary wake remain local. Arming expires on
        disconnect or timeout, and is consumed by one recognized wake.

config COMPANION_FOLLOWUP
    bool "Companion bounded two-turn conversation"
    depends on COMPANION_CLOUD_WAKE
    default n
    help
        Add an explicit conversation arm. Keep one Gemini connection across
        two replies, checking a local four-second follow-up capture after
        each reply. Quiet input is discarded locally. Boot stays unarmed.

config COMPANION_STANDALONE
    bool "Companion autonomous wake conversations"
    depends on COMPANION_FOLLOWUP
    default n
    help
        Start saved Wi-Fi at boot and allow a local wake to start the bounded
        two-answer conversation without USB arming or a PC heartbeat. Keep
        local wake available offline. Diagnostic clients can pause automation.

endmenu
